 Ina here, fresh off an amazing first Valkyries playoff game at Ballhalla. Today's AI+ is 1,301 words, a 5-minute read.

 🍽️ Situational awareness: Dario Amodei, who agreed to a private, last-minute White House dinner with President Trump, is having quite the moment in the spotlight . The Anthropic CEO has become one of the AI industry's most prominent voices — and an unlikely spokesperson for a technology reshaping the economy.

 
 
